# The grey box's frame rate, stood still at points up the stairs (booted on foot: BOOT_ON_FOOT 1).
# The debug line's fps and cpu are one-second averages, so each stop waits 2.5 s before its shot:
# the figures are for that view alone. A run up first (over the crate, to just short of the
# stairs), then short walks of ~100 between stops: the stairs' foot, up them, the platform facing
# the tower. Read each shot's first line (fps, cpu, pk) and third (where you stand: out is x less
# the corridor's wall, 8000; the stairs are out 3360-3600)
# Film it: tests\e2e\run_e2e.ps1 -Steps stairs_perf.steps
wait_up
wait 2.5
shot sp_00_start
keydown up
wait 5.8
keyup up
wait 2.5
shot sp_01_stairs_foot
hold up 0.6
wait 2.5
shot sp_02_stairs_low
hold up 0.6
wait 2.5
shot sp_03_stairs_mid
hold up 0.6
wait 2.5
shot sp_04_stairs_high
hold up 0.6
wait 2.5
shot sp_05_platform
hold up 0.6
wait 2.5
shot sp_06_platform_mid
hold up 0.6
wait 2.5
shot sp_07_platform_end
